Bacteria. 463 spp. &amp; 6 infraspecific taxa.
Chromista. 1968 spp. &amp; 413 infraspecific taxa.
Fungi. 24571 spp. &amp; 1124 infraspecific taxa.
Plantae (Plants). 39539 spp. &amp; 7561 infraspecific taxa.
Protozoa. 2503 spp. &amp; 63 infraspecific taxa.
Viruses. 655 spp. &amp; 150 infraspecific taxa.</generalTaxonomicCoverage>
